    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "FYI, betainc can be expressed as a function of hyp2f1 (new in JAX 0.6.1):\n```python\n@jax.jit\ndef betainc2(a, b, x):\n    return x**a * jax.scipy.special.hyp2f1(a, 1 - b, a + 1, x) / a / jax.scipy.special.beta(a, b)\n```\nHowever, the above is 20x slower than native betainc and has precision problems for x approaching to 1.",
